      "prompt": "<strong>[Hard] Production Log Analysis and Endpoint Latency Aggregation</strong><p>Write sample log lines into <code>access.log</code>. Stream through the file line by line using <code>for line in f:</code>. For every line where the endpoint token equals <code>'/api/v1/checkout'</code>, record the latency float. Compute average checkout latency into float <code>avg_checkout_latency</code> and count total log lines in <code>total_req_count</code>.</p>",
      "ref": "log_data = (\n    '10:00:01 [GET] /api/v1/health 12 200\\n'\n    '10:00:02 [POST] /api/v1/checkout 140 200\\n'\n    '10:00:03 [GET] /api/v1/items 45 200\\n'\n    '10:00:04 [POST] /api/v1/checkout 150 500\\n'\n    '10:00:05 [GET] /api/v1/items 40 200\\n'\n    '10:00:06 [POST] /api/v1/checkout 145 200\\n'\n)\nwith open('access.log', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    f.write(log_data)\ntotal_req_count = 0\ncheckout_latencies = []\nwith open('access.log', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    for line in f:\n        total_req_count += 1\n        parts = line.strip().split()\n        if len(parts) >= 5 and parts[2] == '/api/v1/checkout':\n            checkout_latencies.append(float(parts[3]))\navg_checkout_latency = sum(checkout_latencies) / len(checkout_latencies)\n",
      "solution": "log_data = (\n    '10:00:01 [GET] /api/v1/health 12 200\\n'\n    '10:00:02 [POST] /api/v1/checkout 140 200\\n'\n    '10:00:03 [GET] /api/v1/items 45 200\\n'\n    '10:00:04 [POST] /api/v1/checkout 150 500\\n'\n    '10:00:05 [GET] /api/v1/items 40 200\\n'\n    '10:00:06 [POST] /api/v1/checkout 145 200\\n'\n)\nwith open('access.log', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    f.write(log_data)\ntotal_req_count = 0\ncheckout_latencies = []\nwith open('access.log', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    for line in f:\n        total_req_count += 1\n        parts = line.strip().split()\n        if len(parts) >= 5 and parts[2] == '/api/v1/checkout':\n            checkout_latencies.append(float(parts[3]))\navg_checkout_latency = sum(checkout_latencies) / len(checkout_latencies)\n",
